  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a respected medic in the Featherguard, 'Rotten Reddy' fell victim to a virulent strain of Subchain Rot, reanimating him with a grim purpose. He now wanders the blasted streets, seeking a cure while dispensing his uniquely pungent brand of battlefield 'aid'.",
